* Fri Sep 25 2026 Joachim Klahr <klahr@r8.rs> 0.1.0-1
- First release
- Blood alcohol estimate in per mille from height, weight, age and sex
  (Watson body water, Widmark), with a graph of past and expected levels
- When you will be sober, with a configurable limit line in the graph,
  0.2 per mille by default
- Drink presets with name, size, alcohol and a photo, prefilled from
  Open Food Facts, picked from the gallery or taken with the camera
- Start and finish drinks, edit finished ones, start another from the cover
- Mood prompts every 30 minutes, and how you usually feel at the level
  another drink would take you to, how long a pause keeps you lower and
  when to stop, from your moods tonight and before
- Exposure of the evening in per mille hours, and a morning check-in the
  day after that learns from which exposure mornings are usually rough
